## Final verification

The final combined run passed **216 tests, 0 failures**, including current-file/immutable-parent receipt replay. It emitted 5,680 instances of the same Python 3.14 `pytest_asyncio` deprecation. Ruff passed all changed Python files and `git diff --check` found no whitespace errors (Git issued normal LF-to-CRLF notices). Independent native re-review found no remaining actionable concern in the narrow alias fix; the parent verified its source and executed the tests.

Artifact checks verify that the master, pour-card columns and design JSON agree on all 23 doses; totals remain 6,000/3,000 µL; basket order is correct; all design runtime stock IDs match the fresh report; the full formatter output is preserved; the semantic formula hash still matches after analysis was appended; all 23 numeric opening OAVs equal the previous proxy report; sensory-observation and promotion arrays remain empty. A Windows default-code-page decoding error in the read-only artifact check was corrected by explicitly selecting UTF-8; no formula bytes were changed for that retry.
